@startuml offering-enterprise-boundary
title Offering / Enterprise Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Enterprise" as E
class "Offering" as O

E --> O : offers
O -[dotted]- E : is NOT
E -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 7:
  Enterprise offers Offerings. An Offering is offered by an
  Enterprise, but an Offering is NOT an Enterprise.
end note

@enduml
